<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.0000 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 10		  Apr 9</p>
<p> High			     75.5000		 74.3398</p>
<p> Low				75.2000		 74.9999</p>
<p> Open			     75.3500		 75.3398</p>
<p> Close			    75.5000		 75.0000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    3.640		   6.400</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Apr 10		  Apr 9</p>
<p> High			     43.9000		 44.3000</p>
<p> Low				43.7200		 43.6500</p>
<p> Open			     43.7200		 43.6500</p>
<p> Close			    43.9000		 44.3000</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	   0.045		   0.040</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
